&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Mitratech&#39;s engineering organization is a collaborative and dynamic environment where engineers have the autonomy to drive technical direction and innovate. Our engineers are passionate about building high-quality, scalable&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;solutions that meet the evolving needs of our customers and the legal technology industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;in the middle of an active shift toward AI-augmented engineering — using AI agents and tooling across the SDLC — and Principal Engineers play&amp;nbsp;a central role&amp;nbsp;in shaping how that transformation happens.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
